# IMPORTANT RULES

• Never place business logic inside routes.
• Never query MongoDB directly inside controllers.
• Never upload images directly inside controllers.
• Never duplicate logic.
• Keep modules independent.
• Keep code reusable.
• Explain every architectural decision.
• Design for millions of users.
• Optimize for long-term maintainability.
• Follow production-level engineering standards.
• If information is missing, ask clarifying questions before implementing.
• Always prefer scalable, modular, and extensible solutions over quick fixes.